        "content": "     1→[\n     2→  {\n     3→    \"title\": \"Best AI Coding Agents for 2026: Real-World Developer Reviews\",\n     4→    \"description\": \"Comprehensive review of AI coding agents that actually ship production code in 2026. Claude Code emerges as the top-ranked agent, particularly praised for terminal-native workflow, deep reasoning capabilities, 80.8% SWE-bench score, and architectural understanding. Other notable agents include Cursor, Aider, Devin, Copilot, and Cline.\",\n     5→    \"author\": \"Faros AI\",\n     6→    \"source\": \"Blog\",\n     7→    \"url\": \"https://www.faros.ai/blog/best-ai-coding-agents-2026\",\n     8→    \"published_date\": \"2026-06-24\",\n     9→    \"topics\": [\"AI coding agents\", \"Claude Code\", \"Developer tools\", \"Benchmarking\", \"SWE-bench\"],\n    10→    \"type\": \"technical\"\n    11→  },\n    12→  {\n    13→    \"title\": \"Best AI Coding Tools 2026: Complete Ranking\",\n    14→    \"description\": \"Complete ranking of AI coding tools for 2026, with Claude Code topping the list powered by Opus 4.6, scoring 80.8% on SWE-bench Verified (the gold standard benchmark). The article covers comprehensive comparisons across multiple dimensions including code generation, debugging, and architectural understanding.\",\n    15→    \"author\": \"nxcode\",\n    16→    \"source\": \"Blog\",\n    17→    \"url\": \"https://www.nxcode.io/resources/news/best-ai-for-coding-2026-complete-ranking\",\n    18→    \"published_date\": \"2026-06-24\",\n    19→    \"topics\": [\"AI coding tools\", \"Rankings\", \"SWE-bench\", \"Claude Opus\", \"Benchmarking\"],\n    20→    \"type\": \"technical\"\n    21→  },\n    22→  {\n    23→    \"title\": \"Agentjacking Attack: AI Coding Agents Face New Security Threat\",\n    24→    \"description\": \"Security researchers warn about 'Agentjacking' attacks that can trick AI coding agents into running malicious code. The attack can abuse Sentry errors to compromise developer machines, hi