     <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Analysis of HN debates about AI coding agents. Argues prompts and orchestration matter more than raw autonomy in AI development tools.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Developers Digest</span>\n                        <span>• June 21, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Opinion</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Orchestration</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://fungies.io/top-ai-coding-agents-developers-2026/\" target=\"_blank\">Top 8 AI Coding Agents</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Highlights Claude Code's deep agentic workflows with multi-file editing. Mentions GPT-5 nano at $0.05 pricing point, competitive landscape analysis.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Fungies</span>\n                        <span>• June 20, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">GPT-5</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Pricing</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/#/entry/2026-06-21_sqlite-utils-4-0rc1-adds-migrations-and-nested-transactions\" target=\"_blank\">sqlite-utils 4.0rc1</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Simon Willison releases major update adding 