enchmarking</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.nxcode.io/resources/news/best-ai-for-coding-2026-complete-ranking\" target=\"_blank\">Best AI Coding Tools 2026</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Claude Code tops list powered by Opus 4.6, scoring 80.8% on SWE-bench Verified. Complete ranking across code generation, debugging, and architectural understanding.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">nxcode</span>\n                        <span>• June 24, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Rankings</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Claude Opus</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://thehackernews.com/2026/06/agentjacking-attack-tricks-ai-coding.html\" target=\"_blank\">Agentjacking Attack Warning</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Security researchers warn about \"Agentjacking\" attacks that trick AI coding agents into running malicious code through Sentry errors, highlighting new vulnerabilities in AI workflows.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">The Hacker News</span>\n                        <span>• June 23, 2026</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Security</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Vulnerabilities</span>\n          