     <div class=\"section-header\">\n                    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Whitelist Updates</h2>\n                    <span class=\"section-count\">4 items</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"update-badge\">Claude Code</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/whats-new\" class=\"accent-link\" target=\"_blank\">Week 24: /cd command and nested sub-agents</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-tag\">2026-06-12</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        v2.1.166–v2.1.176 released. /cd to move sessions, sub-agents can spawn sub-agents (5 levels deep), --safe-mode, and fallbackModel config.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"feedback-item feedback-negative\">\n                        \"Users discussing potentially 10x price increases under the new plan for certain usage patterns\" - HN\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"update-badge\">Cursor</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" class=\"accent-link\" target=\"_blank\">June 2026: /automate skill and enhanced cloud agents</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-tag\">2026-06-22</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        /automate skill for creating automations, GitHub/Slack triggers, cloud setup in 10 min, Bugbot 3x faster and 22% cheaper.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"feedback-item feedback-positive\">\n                        \"damn, even automation can now be automated\" - Reddit\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"update-badge\">GitHub Copilot</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" class=\"accent-link\" target=\"_blank\">Copilot CLI GA, Agent Finder, Auto Mode, and Claude Fable 5</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-tag\">2026-06-23</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Copilot CLI GA (June 23), Agent Finder, Auto Mode for all users, BYOK support, Claude Fable 5 GA (June 9), enterprise enhancements.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"feedback-item feedback-positive\">\n                        \"GitHub Copilot Agent Mode automatically fixes code generation errors\" - X\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"update-badge\">Devin</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/overview\" class=\"accent-link\" target=\"_blank\">June 2026: Session folders, automations, and Devin Review</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-tag\">2026-06-24</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Session folders, !ultra and !fast toggles, smarter emoji reactions, custom OAuth, Devin Review improvements, personal automations, V3 API enhancements.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"feedback-item feedback-positive\">\n                        \"Most AI coding tools wait until you ask for help, but Devin's approach is different\" - Reddit\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Section -->\n            <section class=\"section technical-insights\" id=\"insights\">\n                <div class=\"section-header\">\n                    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Technical Insights</h2>\n                    <span class=\"section-count\">10 items</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.faros.ai/blog/best-ai-coding-agents-2026\" class=\"accent-link\" target=\"_blank\">Best AI Coding Agents for 2026</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-tag\">Faros AI</span>\n                        <span class=\"meta-tag\">2026-06-24</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Claude Code emerges as top-ranked agent with 80.8% SWE-bench score and deep reasoning capabilities.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude Code</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">SWE-bench</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Rankings</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.nxcode.io/resources/news/best-ai-for-coding-2026-complete-ranking\" class=\"accent-link\" target=\"_blank\">Best AI Coding Tools 2026: Complete Ranking</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-tag\">nxcode</span>\n                        <span class=\"meta-tag\">2026-06-24</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Claude Code tops ranking powered by Opus 4.6, scoring 80.8% on SWE-bench Verified.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Rankings</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude Opus</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Benchmarking</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://dev.to/sonotommy/8-ai-coding-agents-that-actually-ship-production-code-in-2026-18ch\" class=\"accent-link\" target=\"_blank\">8 AI Coding Agents That Ship Production Code</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-tag\">Dev.to</span>\n                        <span class=\"meta-tag\">2026-06-22</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Claude Code: terminal-native agent that reasons before it acts. Aider: Git-aware CLI pair programmer, fully open source.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Production tools</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Open source</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">CLI tools</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://onyx.app/best-llm-for-coding\" class=\"accent-link\" target=\"_blank\">Best LLM for Coding 2026 | Model Rankings</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-tag\">Onyx</span>\n                        <span class=\"meta-tag\">2026-06-18</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Claude Fable 5 ranked best overall, followed by Claude Mythos Preview and GPT-5.4/5.5.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">LLM rankings</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude Fable</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">GPT-5</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://medium.com/@addyosmani/my-llm-coding-workflow-going-into-2026-52fe1681325e\" class=\"accent-link\" target=\"_blank\">My LLM Coding Workflow Going Into 2026</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-tag\">Addy Osmani</span>\n                        <span class=\"meta-tag\">2026-06-15</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Insights on planning, coding, and collaborating with AI. Tools like gitingest and repo2txt for context packaging.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">LLM workflow</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Productivity</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Context management</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.fluxhire.ai/blog/ai-agents-2026-complete-guide\" class=\"accent-link\" target=\"_blank\">AI Agents in 2026: The Complete Guide</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"meta-tag\">Fluxhire</span>\n                        <span class=\"meta-tag\">2026-06-16</span>\n            